# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day21

## Question 1

The flight was delayed _____ bad weather.

A. because
B. because of
C. although
D. despite

Answer: B

---

## Question 2

_____ it was raining, the employees arrived on time.

A. Despite
B. Because of
C. Although
D. In spite

Answer: C

---

## Question 3

_____ the high cost, the company decided to purchase the equipment.

A. Although
B. Because
C. Despite
D. Because of

Answer: C

---

## Question 4

The event was canceled because _____ heavy snow.

A. of
B. it
C. although
D. despite

Answer: A

→ because of + 명사

---

## Challenge

_____ being tired, she continued working.

A. Although
B. Because
C. Despite
D. Because of

Answer: C

---

## Key Point

because + S + V

because of + N

although + S + V

despite + N / -ing

in spite of + N / -ing
